#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
bd-memory-dreamer — Cross-Harness Episodic Memory Consolidator ("Dreamer" Swarm #11)

Harvests completed technical receipts, bug resolutions, credentials, benchmarks,
and session insights across all Boylenet harnesses (Claude, Codex, Kimi, Hermes,
OpenClaw, OpenCode, AGY) and indexes consolidated structured memories into:
  1) PostgreSQL (10.0.70.164:5432, databases `boylenet_memory` & `litellm`,
     table `boylenet_episodic_memory` with GIN FTS index)
  2) Qdrant Vector DB (http://10.0.70.125:6333, collection `boylenet_episodic_memory`,
     1024-dim Cosine vectors embedded via local TEI http://10.0.70.164:8081/embed)
  3) CLI Query Interface:
     - bd-memory-dreamer --consolidate [--json]
     - bd-memory-dreamer --recall "<query>" [--top-k 5] [--json]
     - bd-memory-dreamer --stats [--json]
"""

